From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:02:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Copy custom bootsplash BMP to the ESP

[ouroBIOS: commit afe0e87d25d5 of MrChromebox's edk2, without the files
that TianoCore's tree does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 7 in
edk2/OuroBiosPkg]

Storing a USB device path made custom logos disappear after the media
was removed. Validate the BMP at import with the same checks used at
boot, copy it to \EFI\BootSplash\logo.bmp on the first ESP, and
persist that path. Reject files over 4 MiB or that do not fit the
display, and tell the user when import fails.

Signed-off-by: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
---
